            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Caroline"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm sitting here with the flu, freezing and have a 101 temp. I saw this and thought I really want that... so I made it. I added a teaspoon of vanilla and a tiny bit of Tia Maria (like Kahlua but better ha ha) - let me tell you this is a royal treat. I feel better already and I haven't finished it yet!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lizzy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I improvised since we have neither a steaming pitcher nor steaming wand. I added whole milk to the eggnog (Promised Land) and heated them in the microwave. I added a shot of Seattle Style Dark (made in our Keurig machine) and a helping of Reddiwip with some nutmeg. Not how this recipe was written but it was divine and were grateful for this recipe's inspiration!",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-01T15:58:59.880Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ingrid C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So easy &amp; quick! Used an immersion blender to whip the eggnog &amp; milk, added a bit of vanilla syrup to taste. Delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2016-12-06T21:13:21.490Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
